{"title":"Bell","sourceTitle":"Bell/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.19.4</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Bell/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Glocke (14% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bell\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Bell (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bell/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Cloche (14% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bell/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Колокол (14% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bell/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"响铃 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div style=\"margin: 0 1em 1em; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; float:right; width:250px; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><table style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);&#125;&#125;\">\n<big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Sino</span></b></big></th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"margin:auto; text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-bell-normal.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/ed/Creature-bell-normal.png/180px-Creature-bell-normal.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ed/Creature-bell-normal.png/270px-Creature-bell-normal.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ed/Creature-bell-normal.png/360px-Creature-bell-normal.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:60%\"><b>Tipo</b></td><td> <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Land\" class=\"new\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Land (page does not exist)\">Terreno (subterrâneo)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=Land&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Land (page does not exist)\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical\">mecânico</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mechanical\" title=\"Mechanical\"> </a></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> </td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ccbcab;\"><td style=\"width:60%\"><b>Comportamento</b></td><td> <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Hostile_creatures\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Hostile creatures\">Hostil</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Hostile_creatures| ]]</span> </td></tr>\n\n<tr><td style=\"width:60%\"><b>Gerar</b></td><td> \n<div><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Light\" class=\"new\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Light (page does not exist)\">Nível de luz:</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=Light&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Light (page does not exist)\"> </a></span></b> 5<br /><b>Blocos:</b> air<br />\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n<br /><br />\nUm <b>bell</b> é uma criatura subterrânea rara com saúde extremamente alta.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Desova\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Desova</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Desaparecendo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Desaparecendo</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Comportamentos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comportamentos</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Invocando_monstros\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Invocando monstros</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Colheita\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Colheita</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Observações\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Observações</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Veja_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Veja também</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Spawning\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Desova\">Desova</span></h2>\n<p>Os sinos aparecem apenas no subsolo, no máximo <abbr title=\"70%\">0.7</abbr><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> do nível do mar mundial. Eles não podem aparecer onde os níveis de luz estão acima de 5.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Eles sempre aparecem sozinhos, mas até 3 <i>poderiam</i> aparecer no mesmo pedaço; a chance de desova é <abbr title=\"0.18%\">0.0018</abbr>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><span id=\"Despawning\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Desaparecendo\">Desaparecendo</span></h3>\n<p>Os sinos devem desaparecer se estiverem a pelo menos 30 quarteirões de distância do jogador por 15 minutos<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> com o pedaço ainda carregado. Se o jogador se afastar mais de 140 quarteirões ou usar um translocador, o sino provavelmente reaparecerá em seu último local quando aquele pedaço for recarregado.\n</p><p><span id=\"Behaviors\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comportamentos\">Comportamentos</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:250px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Sino</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-bell-normal.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/ed/Creature-bell-normal.png/130px-Creature-bell-normal.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ed/Creature-bell-normal.png/195px-Creature-bell-normal.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ed/Creature-bell-normal.png/260px-Creature-bell-normal.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde</b>\n</td>\n<td>100<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ataque Base</b>\n</td>\n<td>N / D\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Habilidades</b>\n</td>\n<td>Convocar monstros\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Alcance de busca (m)</b>\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Gotas</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rusty_gear\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rusty gear\">Engrenagem enferrujada</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rusty_gear\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rusty gear\"> </a></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.2 - 2.2<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal_parts\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal parts\">Partes de metal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal_parts\" title=\"Metal parts\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>1.5<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal_scraps\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal scraps\">Sucata</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal_scraps\" title=\"Metal scraps\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>1.5 - 5.5<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">Cilindro de ajuste</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>1 (song title varies)<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Jonas_part\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Jonas part\">Jonas parte<br />(todos os tipos)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Jonas_part\" title=\"Jonas part\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.2<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Mobs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mobs\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Multidões</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\nOs sinos são atraídos para áreas de nível de luz 15.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Embora os sinos não tenham habilidade de ataque ou nível de dano, eles podem invocar um grande número de outros monstros, sobrecarregando o jogador se o sino não for destruído rapidamente.\n</p><p>Os sinos se movem muito lentamente: 0,0065 andando, 0,01 nadando.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Os sinos têm 0,01 chance de realizar uma animação ociosa de \"ocultar\" por 200.000-800.000 milissegundos,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> ou 0,50 de chance de executar uma animação ociosa de \"ouvir\" por 4.000-6.000 milissegundos.\nA animação de \"ocultar\" é interrompida se o sino receber dano ou se um jogador se aproximar dentro de 10 blocos.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><span id=\"Summoning&#95;monsters\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Invocando_monstros\">Invocando monstros</span></h3>\n<p>Quando um jogador chega a 15 quarteirões de um sino, ele começa a tocar um alarme que gera inimigos em um raio de 12 quarteirões ao seu redor:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Drifter\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Drifter\">Vagantes das profundezas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Drifter\" title=\"Drifter\"> </a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Drifter\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Drifter\">Vagantes contaminados</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Drifter\" title=\"Drifter\"> </a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Drifter\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Drifter\">Vagantes corrompidos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Drifter\" title=\"Drifter\"> </a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Locust\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Locust\">Locustas de bronzes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Locust\" title=\"Locust\"> </a></span></li></ul>\n<p>O número máximo de inimigos deve ser 6 por vez, com um intervalo de 1.000 a 5.000 milissegundos entre o surgimento do próximo.\n</p><p><span id=\"Harvesting\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Colheita\">Colheita</span></h3>\n<p>O jogador não precisa usar uma faca em um sino morto para obter o saque; o saque cai sozinho.\n</p><p>Pelo menos 1 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">cilindro de afinação</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span> cai de cada sino, com todas as melodias tendo chances iguais de cair:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<caption>Tuning cylinder drop rates\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Song title</th>\n<th><abbr title=\"Chance of being the cylinder dropped\">Drop chance</abbr></th>\n<th>item ID\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">Os Serafins</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span></td>\n<td><abbr title=\"10%\">0.1</abbr></td>\n<td><code>tuningcylinder-1</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">Através da grama à noite</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n<td><code>tuningcylinder-2</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">Aldeia Ensolarada</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n<td><code>tuningcylinder-3</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">A invenção</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n<td><code>tuningcylinder-4</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">Taberna Culta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n<td><code>tuningcylinder-5</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">Aldeia Pacífica</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n<td><code>tuningcylinder-6</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">História antiga</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n<td><code>tuningcylinder-7</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">Taberna peculiar</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n<td><code>tuningcylinder-8</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">Hallowcroft</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n<td><code>tuningcylinder-9</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning cylinder\">Passeio de verão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_cylinder\" title=\"Tuning cylinder\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n<td><code>tuningcylinder-10</code>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Bell permanece desaparecendo após 24 horas de jogo.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3rico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Histórico\">Histórico</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\"Observa.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Observações\">Observações</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Classes#Clockmaker\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Classes\">Aula de relojoeiro</a> causa +25% de dano contra entidades mecânicas.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Gallery\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"See&#95;also\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Veja_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Veja_também\">Veja também</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 12 of %appdata%\\Roaming\\Vintagestory\\assets\\survival\\entities\\land\\bell.json</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 176 of %appdata%\\Roaming\\Vintagestory\\assets\\survival\\entities\\land\\bell.json</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 171 of %appdata%\\Roaming\\Vintagestory\\assets\\survival\\entities\\land\\bell.json and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://apidocs.vintagestory.at/json-docs/jsondocs/Vintagestory.API.Common.EnumLightLevelType.html\">